    <p><strong>Alteryx</strong> - Cloud Engineer (March 2022 - January 2024)</p>
    <p><strong>Auto-Owners Insurance</strong> - Predictive Modeler, Analytics R&D (June 2020 - March 2022)</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Technologies I consider myself proficient at:</h2>

