    <p><strong>Database:</strong> <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/" target="_blank">Postgres</a></p>

    <p><strong>DevOps & CI/CD:</strong> <a href="https://argo-cd.readthedocs.io/" target="_blank">ArgoCD</a>, <a href="https://helm.sh/" target="_blank">Helm</a>, <a href="https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/ci/" target="_blank">GitLab CI/CD</a>, <a href="https://github.com/features/actions" target="_blank">GitHub Actions</a>, <a href="https://www.docker.com/" target="_blank">Docker</a></p>

